<title>USA: Manhattan Bagel in 12-store franshise pact.</title>
<headline>Manhattan Bagel in 12-store franshise pact.</headline>
<dateline>EATONTOWN, N.J. 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Manhattan Bagel Co Inc said on Friday that it had completed a 12-store, three-year franchise agreement with Queens Bagel Enterprise for an undisclosed dollar amount.</p>
<p>Under terms of the agreement, Queens Bagel, a privately owned Queens-based firm, will open 12 stores in the New York City boroughs, Manhattan Bagel said in a statement.</p>
<p>Manhattan Bagel shops sell New York-style bagels in 19 states.</p>
